				'we_install_in' => array(
					array('title'=>'Cinco Ranch','content'=>'Houston\'s largest Katy master-planned community — heavy prairie clay subgrades, strict architectural-review process governing front and side-yard grass varieties, and aging builder-installed Raleigh St. Augustine that hits its predictable failure curve at year 3–5. The bulk of our Cinco Ranch work is documented re-sod with topsoil amendment and review-board paperwork.'),
					array('title'=>'Cross Creek Ranch','content'=>'Newer master-planned community west of Cinco Ranch with stricter architectural-review standards and more shade-tree maturity than people expect. Most installs here are Palmetto St. Augustine over an amended surface, with Zeon Zoysia upgrades on pool-adjacent properties. The HOA modification request paperwork ships with every quote.'),
					array('title'=>'Firethorne','content'=>'Mid-sized Katy MPC with classic prairie-clay drainage issues — most Firethorne re-sods need a regrade and at least surface drainage correction before the new sod goes down. Lot sizes here support Bermuda in full-sun front yards and Palmetto St. Augustine in shaded back yards; we zone the install rather than picking one variety for the whole lot.'),
					array('title'=>'Seven Meadows & Grand Lakes','content'=>'Established Katy ISD neighborhoods with mature tree canopy and the heaviest clay we install on in the area. St. Augustine dominates here; we have never had a Bermuda install survive long-term under the Seven Meadows / Grand Lakes shade canopy. Soil amendment depth runs to the high end of our normal Katy range (closer to 3 inches than 2).'),
					array('title'=>'Falcon Ranch & Cane Island','content'=>'Falcon Ranch is older Katy ISD territory with established drainage issues; Cane Island is the premium newer build north of I-10 with stricter HOA review and larger lot sizes. We see hybrid sod-plus-hydroseed plans on the larger Cane Island lots regularly, and pure premium-sod installs on the smaller architecturally-curated Cane Island Garden Homes.'),
