					array('heading'=>'Pecan Grove & Greatwood established residential','content'=>'Re-sod under mature pecan and oak canopy with selective canopy limb-up, surface-root pruning, pH amendment, and shade-tolerant Palmetto St. Augustine installed over a properly amended surface. Most established Richmond installs we touch fit this profile.'),
