</ul>',
				'signature_method_content' => '<p class="text-stone-200 mb-5 leading-relaxed">For half-acre-plus properties in Tomball, our hybrid model delivers a finished, magazine-worthy front yard with cost-efficient coverage across the rest of the lot.</p>

