				'we_install_in' => array(
					array('title'=>'Tuscan Lakes','content'=>'League City\'s largest master-planned community with mixed elevation across the property and a strict architectural-review process. Drainage scope varies dramatically lot-to-lot here — some Tuscan Lakes lots need minimal drainage work, others need full French drain installation. We elevation-check every Tuscan Lakes lot before quoting. Palmetto St. Augustine is the most-approved variety.'),
					array('title'=>'Mar Bella','content'=>'Lakeside master-planned community with high water table proximity across most filings. Almost universally requires elevation fill and French drain installation as part of standard install scope — without those steps, even premium sod fails within 18 months due to root rot from saturated subsoil. HOA review applies.'),
