					array('heading'=>'Kings River & Bear Branch village homeowners','content'=>'Established mid-Kingwood residential with mature canopy and HOA review enforcement. Most installs are Palmetto St. Augustine with the standard Kingwood canopy work, surface-root pruning, and pH amendment built into scope. KSA modification request paperwork ships with every proposal.'),
