					array('heading'=>'Grogan\'s Mill, Cochran\'s Crossing & Indian Springs village homeowners','content'=>'Re-sod over aging Woodlands turf under 30+ year mature pine and oak canopy with full canopy limb-up, surface-root pruning, pH-corrected organic amendment, and shade-tolerant Palmetto St. Augustine. The bulk of our Woodlands residential book.'),
