				'lawn_challenges' => array('Heavy shade','Tree-root competition','Strict community standards'),
				'we_install_in' => array(
					array('title'=>'Carlton Woods','content'=>'The Woodlands\' premier gated estate community on heavy mature canopy with the strictest architectural review in The Woodlands. Almost universally Palmetto St. Augustine over an organic-amended, pH-corrected, root-pruned surface, with Zeon Zoysia upgrades on premium pool-adjacent and signature front-yard zones. WDSC paperwork ships with every Carlton Woods quote.'),
					array('title'=>'Sterling Ridge','content'=>'Premium Woodlands estate village with mature canopy and lake-adjacent properties. Lot sizes here support both Palmetto St. Augustine and Zeon Zoysia depending on canopy density and homeowner preference. We default to Zeon Zoysia on premium pool-adjacent and signature visible zones, Palmetto St. Augustine on family-lawn zones.'),
