				'heading_text' => 'Sod Installation & Grass Establishment in Sugar Land, TX',
				'short_description_listing_view' => 'Telfair, Riverstone, Sweetwater, and Greatwood — Sugar Land is one of our highest-value premium master-planned markets.',
				'short_description' => 'Telfair, Riverstone, Sweetwater, and Greatwood — Sugar Land is one of our highest-value premium master-planned markets.',
